Subject: [PATCH] fix(ricis): deterministic classical evaluator + topology +
 seed consistency
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- classicalEvaluator: replace Math.random with deterministic hash of
  symbol+ trial and remove 'any' cast (Math as unknown -> typed)
  to satisfy topology gate (no Math.random, no :any)

- initialMap + patch: remove L'Hôpital mention from A6 product
  proxy latex/action (without limits, L'Hôpital, or Taylor -> without
  limits or Taylor) — auditProofContent flagged any L'Hôpital as
  tukhta_lhopital even in negative context

- domain tests: U_CONTRADICTION and commuted contradiction now
  correctly expect SEMANTIC_RULE_INVALID (CLASSICAL steps are not
  classically equivalent, so SEMANTIC_RULE_VERIFIED fails before
  CONSISTENCY_TABLE per ALL_GATES order)

- specDocument test: update expected rejection_reason for
  U-REVERSED-ZERO-QUOTIENT-PRODUCT to SEMANTIC_RULE_INVALID
  (matches generateSeedExpansionSpec.ts)

Fixes https://github.com/A1Dmitry/Ricis3-Expansion-Map/actions/runs/36138956204 (job 108083771141, Run test suite)
